{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>66 unique battle arenas</strong> with dynamic conditions such as time of day, environment changes, and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>83 combat units</strong>, unlockable via the Tablet system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full character access</strong> \u2014 the entire roster is available for battles from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick match system</strong> \u2014 join <strong>ranked battles</strong> against other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress saving</strong> in ranked mode, with the option to transfer it to the full version upon purchase</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo version limitations:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game modes <strong>Trials</strong>, <strong>Fighting Pits</strong>, and <strong>Training</strong> are not available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick match only supports <strong>ranked battles</strong> in the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress is saved <strong>only for ranked battles</strong> and does not carry over for additional modes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707200?t=1747383747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707200/b7cc751d4343dc11d309c5086b5fb0dd51d515cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747383747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707200/5a8ffbc6aefe05c1b62ff58cd3ec547320814a07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747383747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707200/5a8ffbc6aefe05c1b62ff58cd3ec547320814a07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747383747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"desc